281	// Size Guide content type
282	// One entry per size guide, keyed by a structured `key` field
283	// (pattern: size-guide__{slug} or size-guide__{slug}__{locale}).
284	// Fetched in bulk and resolved client-side via useSizeGuide — see
285	// overrides/app/hooks/useSizeGuide.ts.
286	// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
